sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Ring
    participant E as Edge (Lambda)
    participant B as EventBridge
    participant D as Door agent
    participant N as Nova (vision)
    participant G as Guardian
    participant TV as Fire TV

    R->>E: button_press (HMAC signed)
    E->>E: verify + idempotency
    E-->>R: 200 (target p99 < 150ms)
    E->>B: PutEvents
    B->>D: invoke
    par fast path
        D->>R: POST media/image/download
        R-->>D: snapshot
        D->>G: Phase 1 card
        G->>TV: "Someone's at the front door."
        Note over TV: <= 900ms from webhook
    and slow path
        D->>N: describe(image)
        N-->>D: one sentence
        D->>G: Phase 2 patch
        G->>TV: description patched in
        Note over TV: <= 2200ms · hard-cancel 2500ms
    end
